        <profile name="Lupine Guile" id="1918-061b-2129-9c12" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Once per battle, after rolling off to decide initiative, if this operative is in the killzone, you can re-roll your dice.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grizzled Veteran" id="b2b6-ba42-677d-4034" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">The first time this operative would be incapacitated during the battle, it&apos;s not incapacitated, has 1 wound remaining and cannot be incapacitated for the remainder of the action. All remaining attack dice are discarded (including yours if this operative is fighting or retaliating).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
